<!-- ─── HERO ─── -->
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Service · UK Technology · GCC Delivery</span>
  <h1>AI Automation for Real Business Operations</h1>
  <p>Turn documents, messages and repetitive processes into controlled, connected workflows — AI understands the inputs, business rules decide the logic, systems execute the work, and people stay in control of what matters.</p>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 1: THE BTS DIFFERENCE ─── -->
<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">The BTS difference</span>
    <h2>AI is not the workflow. BTS connects AI to the workflow.</h2>
    <p>Four components work together to make automation reliable in real business operations.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pillars-grid">
    <div class="pillar">
      <div class="num">AI UNDERSTANDS</div>
      <h4>Documents, messages, requests and data</h4>
      <p>Extraction, classification and intent recognition.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <div class="num">BUSINESS RULES DECIDE</div>
      <h4>Thresholds, validation, routing and escalation</h4>
      <p>The logic that governs what should happen next.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <div class="num">SYSTEMS EXECUTE</div>
      <h4>APIs, databases, ERP, CRM and warehouse systems</h4>
      <p>The action layer where the workflow does real work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <div class="num">PEOPLE REMAIN IN CONTROL</div>
      <h4>Approvals, exceptions and oversight</h4>
      <p>Human review where it matters, automatic where it does not.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 2: WHAT WE AUTOMATE ─── -->
<section class="section alt"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">What we automate</span>
    <h2>What can BTS automate?</h2>
    <p>Practical automation for the processes that consume the most time and create the most errors.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="svc"><h3>Document Processing</h3><p>Extract data from invoices, purchase orders, delivery notes, customs documents and other business files.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Data Entry &amp; Validation</h3><p>Move information between documents, spreadsheets, databases and business systems while applying validation rules.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>WhatsApp AI Workflows</h3><p>Connect customer and operational conversations to structured workflows, notifications and internal systems.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Approvals &amp; Escalation</h3><p>Automatically route requests to the right person based on business rules, thresholds and exceptions.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Reporting &amp; Alerts</h3><p>Turn operational data into automated reports, dashboards and real-time alerts.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Repetitive Digital Tasks</h3><p>Automate browser, desktop and system-based processes where appropriate using RPA and APIs.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 3: HOW IT WORKS ─── -->
<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">How it works</span>
    <h2>From manual process to automated workflow</h2>
    <p>Automation is not about replacing people. It is about removing friction from the way work moves through your business.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="flow-vertical" role="list" aria-label="Automation workflow stages">
    <div class="flow-node" role="listitem">Business Process</div>
    <div class="flow-down" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-node" role="listitem">Process Mapping</div>
    <div class="flow-down" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-node" role="listitem">AI + Automation</div>
    <div class="flow-down" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-node" role="listitem">Business Rules</div>
    <div class="flow-down" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-node" role="listitem">Systems &amp; APIs</div>
    <div class="flow-down" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-node" role="listitem">Human Approval</div>
    <div class="flow-down" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-node" role="listitem">Dashboard + Alerts</div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:56px">
    <div class="svc"><h3>Understand</h3><p>We map the existing process and identify bottlenecks.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Automate</h3><p>AI, APIs, workflow automation and RPA are applied where they provide value.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Validate</h3><p>Business rules and human approval points keep important decisions under control.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Integrate</h3><p>Connect the workflow to existing software, databases, APIs and communication channels.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Monitor</h3><p>Dashboards, alerts and reporting provide visibility into performance.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Improve</h3><p>Measure outcomes, refine rules and expand automation to adjacent processes.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 4: BEFORE / WITH BTS ─── -->
<section class="section alt"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">Before / With BTS</span>
    <h2>The same process, without the friction.</h2>
    <p>Automation removes manual steps, replaces them with rules, and keeps people where decisions matter.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="compare-grid">
    <div class="compare-col before">
      <h3>Before BTS</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Email arrives</li>
        <li>PDF is downloaded</li>
        <li>Data entered manually</li>
        <li>Spreadsheet updated</li>
        <li>Message sent via WhatsApp</li>
        <li>Manager approves by email</li>
        <li>Data re-entered in ERP</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-col after">
      <h3>With BTS</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Documents and messages arrive</li>
        <li>AI understands the inputs</li>
        <li>Business rules decide the path</li>
        <li>Systems execute automatically</li>
        <li>People approve the exceptions</li>
        <li>Dashboard updates in real time</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 5: REAL WORKFLOWS ─── -->
<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">Real workflows</span>
    <h2>Three concrete examples</h2>
    <p>Every business has its own workflows. These are the patterns we most often apply.</p>
  </div>

  <figure class="use-case-svg">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 700" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Three common BTS AI automation patterns: invoice automation, logistics document workflow, WhatsApp operations" style="color:var(--text)">
      <style>
        .uc-bg    { fill:var(--bg-2); }
        .uc-card  { fill:var(--bg); stroke:var(--line); stroke-width:1; }
        .uc-title { fill:var(--text); font-family:Inter,sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; }
        .uc-pill  { fill:var(--bg-2); stroke:rgba(74,144,226,0.35); stroke-width:1; }
        .uc-pill-text { fill:var(--text); font-family:Inter,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; text-anchor:middle; dominant-baseline:middle; }
        .uc-arrow { fill:var(--gold); font-family:Inter,sans-serif; font-size:20px; font-weight:700; text-anchor:middle; }
      </style>

      <rect class="uc-bg" width="1200" height="700" rx="12"/>

      <!-- Column 1: Invoice automation -->
      <rect class="uc-card" x="30" y="30" width="360" height="640" rx="12"/>
      <text class="uc-title" x="60" y="70">Invoice automation</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="60" y="100" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="210" y="122">📄 Invoice</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="210" y="162">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="60" y="180" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="210" y="202">🤖 AI extracts data</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="210" y="242">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="60" y="260" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="210" y="282">✅ Validation</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="210" y="322">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="60" y="340" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="210" y="362">📏 Business rules</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="210" y="402">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="60" y="420" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="210" y="442">✍️ Approval</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="210" y="482">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="60" y="500" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="210" y="522">💰 Accounting / ERP</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="210" y="562">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="60" y="580" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="210" y="602">📊 Dashboard</text>

      <!-- Column 2: Logistics -->
      <rect class="uc-card" x="420" y="30" width="360" height="640" rx="12"/>
      <text class="uc-title" x="450" y="70">Logistics document workflow</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="450" y="100" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="600" y="122">📋 BOL / Invoice / Customs</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="600" y="162">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="450" y="180" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="600" y="202">🤖 AI Document Extraction</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="600" y="242">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="450" y="260" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="600" y="282">✅ Data Validation</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="600" y="322">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="450" y="340" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="600" y="362">⚠️ Risk Detection</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="600" y="402">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="450" y="420" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="600" y="442">✍️ Approval / Escalation</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="600" y="482">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="450" y="500" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="600" y="522">🚚 Logistics System</text>

      <!-- Column 3: WhatsApp -->
      <rect class="uc-card" x="810" y="30" width="360" height="640" rx="12"/>
      <text class="uc-title" x="840" y="70">WhatsApp operations</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="840" y="100" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="990" y="122">💬 WhatsApp message</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="990" y="162">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="840" y="180" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="990" y="202">🧠 AI understands request</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="990" y="242">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="840" y="260" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="990" y="282">⚙️ Business rules</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="990" y="322">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="840" y="340" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="990" y="362">🗄️ System / Database</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="990" y="402">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="840" y="420" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="990" y="442">✅ Action or approval</text>
      <text class="uc-arrow" x="990" y="482">↓</text>

      <rect class="uc-pill" x="840" y="500" width="300" height="42" rx="6"/>
      <text class="uc-pill-text" x="990" y="522">💬 WhatsApp response</text>
    </svg>
  </figure>

  <div class="mobile-usecases">
    <div class="usecase">
      <h3>Invoice automation</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Invoice</li>
