</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 6: BUSINESS OUTCOMES ─── -->
<section class="section alt"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">Business outcomes</span>
    <h2>What automation changes for your operations</h2>
