<!-- ─── SECTION 7: WHY BTS ─── -->
<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">Why BTS</span>
    <h2>Why businesses work with BTS</h2>
    <p>Four things that shape how we approach every engagement.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="svc">
      <h3>Start small. Scale when it works.</h3>
      <p>Begin with one process or workflow, prove the value, then expand. No large upfront investment and no big-bang rollout.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc">
      <h3>Built around your existing systems.</h3>
      <p>BTS connects APIs, databases, ERP, CRM, warehouse and communication systems rather than forcing you to replace everything.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc">
      <h3>Arabic + English by design.</h3>
      <p>Interfaces, workflows, notifications and operational documents can support both languages and RTL.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc">
      <h3>UK technology. GCC delivery.</h3>
      <p>Technology and engineering from the UK, designed for organisations operating across UK and GCC environments.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 8: UK + GCC ADVANTAGE ─── -->
<section class="section alt"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">UK + GCC advantage</span>
    <h2>Built for the way UK and GCC businesses actually operate.</h2>
    <p>Our specialisation is the intersection of three things most providers only handle one of.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="advantage-grid">
    <div class="advantage">
      <div class="label">UK ENGINEERING</div>
      <h4>Technology and process discipline</h4>
      <p>Security, integration and architecture designed to UK standards — clean, documented and maintainable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="advantage">
      <div class="label">ARABIC + ENGLISH</div>
      <h4>Bilingual by design, not by translation</h4>
      <p>RTL interfaces, Arabic documents, and workflows that support both languages from day one.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="advantage">
